  "honesty": "Atlas travel_minutes are copied from MAP_MASTER links through W00 trade_graph. They are not recomputed from slope or from a second speed class. sea_crime_sere stays 96 minutes (15 km/h over 24.0 km) even though W03 tags that water open_exodus at 12 km/h. The 2 km grid is not allocated. Mobility is not a W01 field channel. Present metres and Hub canon metres are different clocks. Design-intent multipliers are marked. Flower Law is 42 horizontal metres. world_id Fantasy is the Sundering. Sere has no Link gate. The Crucible-Grid seam stays unfinished.",
